"(c) 2015-2026 The MITRE Corporation. This work reproduces and/or references materials created by
The MITRE Corporation. ATT&CK(R) is a registered trademark of The MITRE Corporation."
Reproduced here: ids, names and links only.

MISP galaxy
The MISP galaxy threat-actor clusters (CC0 1.0, https://github.com/MISP/misp-galaxy) informed the
building of the list of candidate groups. The MISP galaxy tag in the data is a name reference only.

Other names
Group names belong to the vendors and agencies that coined them; they are listed here as
references to the page where each vendor or agency publishes the name.
